  "body": "The definition of origins in general should have for=\"\", while\ndefinitions of a foo's origin should have for=\"foo\".\n\nThis should let folks put `spec:html; type:dfn; text:origin; for:/` in their Bikeshed `link-defaults` sections, and get a link to the right [origin](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#concept-origin). However, I don't have Anolis and haven't tested running the output through Shepherd, so I could be wrong.\n\nI didn't fix the other \"foo's bar\" to have the right `for` value because\ntabatkins/bikeshed#786 might lead to a more general fix.\n\n@annevk @tabatkins\n",
